=== ch8_intro ===
{litConflict >= 0.5 && rumorStuck: Krit left before the first frost, and nobody said goodbye.}
Winter strips the bushes bare, and one mushroom gives dew at dawn: take a little and it gives more, take it all and it withers.
-> END

=== ch8_bet ===
How many will leave before the thaw?
-> END

=== ch8_shares ===
Old Moss carries a drop of dew to Krit, who once kept everything Moss gave, and sets it down without a word.
-> END

=== ch8_close_call ===
{litConflict >= 0.5 && rumorStuck:
    Winter ended, and Krit was not here for Old Moss to forgive.
- else:
    Winter ended, and Old Moss never gave Krit a drop.
}
-> END
